### Agent Company History API Tests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/agent-company-history
@agentTrackingId = AGENT_TRACKING_ID_HERE
@companyTrackingId = COMPANY_TRACKING_ID_HERE
@trackingId = RECORD_TRACKING_ID_HERE

### 1. Create new company history
POST {{baseUrl}}/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "agentTrackingId": "{{agentTrackingId}}",
  "companyTrackingId": "{{companyTrackingId}}",
  "startDate": "2024-01-01T00:00:00",
  "endDate": "2024-12-31T23:59:59",
  "assignmentType": "PERMANENT",
  "notes": "Assigned to new company"
}

### 2. Update company history (Path Variable)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/update/{{trackingId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "agentTrackingId": "{{agentTrackingId}}",
  "companyTrackingId": "{{companyTrackingId}}",
  "startDate": "2024-01-01T00:00:00",
  "endDate": "2024-12-31T23:59:59",
  "assignmentType": "PERMANENT",
  "notes": "Updated notes"
}

### 3. Get specific company history record (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/get/{{trackingId}}

### 4. Get all companies for an agent (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/agent/{{agentTrackingId}}

### 5. Get history by company (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/company/{{companyTrackingId}}

### 6. Get by start date range (Path Variables)
GET {{baseUrl}}/start-date-range/2024-01-01T00:00:00/2024-12-31T23:59:59

### 7. Get current company for an agent (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/agent/{{agentTrackingId}}/current

### 8. Get all company history records
GET {{baseUrl}}/list

### 9. Delete company history record (Path Variable)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/delete/{{trackingId}}
